{'symbol': 'PLD', 'date': '2021-04-21 17:00:00', 'title': 'PROLOGIS CONTINUES GREEN BUILDING LEADERSHIP WITH LEED V4 VOLUME PROGRAM', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PROLOGIS, INC. (NYSE: PLD), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN LOGISTICS REAL ESTATE, ANNOUNCED IT WILL LAUNCH THE FIRST LEED V4 FOR CORE AND SHELL VOLUME PROGRAM FOR THE U.S. LOGISTICS REAL ESTATE SECTOR. THIS NEW PROGRAM INCLUDES MORE RIGOROUS STANDARDS THAN THE PREVIOUS LEED VOLUME PROGRAM, ESTABLISHED IN 2014.'}